ocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nIt does not have the app crash in this:\nv4.4.beta3.official [06acfccf8]\n\nIt does have the app crash in these:\nWas working on the project from this issue when I noticed it:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102319\nusing msvc:\n```\nscons platform=windows arch=x86_64 production=yes debug_symbols=yes\n```\nwithout patch:\nv4.4.beta.custom_build [5da6deaac]\n\nwith patch from here https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102319#issuecomment-2653972432:\nv4.4.beta.custom_build [2ca539c25]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.beta (2ca539c25) - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 9 monitors - Vulkan (Mobile) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7216) - 11th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-11900K @ 3.50GHz (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nRunning this command in a branch newer than 4.4 beta 3 from my scons compile has the issue.\n\nCode from the MRP:\n```gdscript\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tvar file :FileAccess\n\tfile = FileAccess.open(\"res://main.gd\",FileAccess.READ)\n\tprint(file.get_as_text())\n#comment out either of the below lines and it will not crash\n\tfile.close()\n\tfile.get_as_text()\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f1ae2e46-555c-43d6-9948-cc62e82449ea\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp_file_close_text.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18776470/mrp_file_close_text.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/s